  40:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/FilteringFunctions/arm_conv_q15.c **** /**
  41:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/FilteringFunctions/arm_conv_q15.c ****  * @brief Convolution of Q15 sequences.
  42:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/FilteringFunctions/arm_conv_q15.c ****  * @param[in] *pSrcA points to the first input sequence.
  43:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/FilteringFunctions/arm_conv_q15.c ****  * @param[in] srcALen length of the first input sequence.
  44:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/FilteringFunctions/arm_conv_q15.c ****  * @param[in] *pSrcB points to the second input sequence.
  45:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/FilteringFunctions/arm_conv_q15.c ****  * @param[in] srcBLen length of the second input sequence.
  46:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/FilteringFunctions/arm_conv_q15.c ****  * @param[out] *pDst points to the location where the output result is written.  Length srcALen+src
  47:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/FilteringFunctions/arm_conv_q15.c ****  * @return none.
  48:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/FilteringFunctions/arm_conv_q15.c ****  *
  49:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/FilteringFunctions/arm_conv_q15.c ****  * @details
  50:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/FilteringFunctions/arm_conv_q15.c ****  * <b>Scaling and Overflow Behavior:</b>
  51:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/FilteringFunctions/arm_conv_q15.c ****  *
  52:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/FilteringFunctions/arm_conv_q15.c ****  * \par
  53:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/FilteringFunctions/arm_conv_q15.c ****  * The function is implemented using a 64-bit internal accumulator.
  54:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/FilteringFunctions/arm_conv_q15.c ****  * Both inputs are in 1.15 format and multiplications yield a 2.30 result.
  55:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/FilteringFunctions/arm_conv_q15.c ****  * The 2.30 intermediate results are accumulated in a 64-bit accumulator in 34.30 format.
  56:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/FilteringFunctions/arm_conv_q15.c ****  * This approach provides 33 guard bits and there is no risk of overflow.
  57:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/FilteringFunctions/arm_conv_q15.c ****  * The 34.30 result is then truncated to 34.15 format by discarding the low 15 bits and then satura
  58:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/FilteringFunctions/arm_conv_q15.c ****  *
  59:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/FilteringFunctions/arm_conv_q15.c ****  * \par
  60:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/FilteringFunctions/arm_conv_q15.c ****  * Refer to <code>arm_conv_fast_q15()</code> for a faster but less precise version of this function
  61:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/FilteringFunctions/arm_conv_q15.c ****  *
  62:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/FilteringFunctions/arm_conv_q15.c ****  * \par
  63:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/FilteringFunctions/arm_conv_q15.c ****  * Refer the function <code>arm_conv_opt_q15()</code> for a faster implementation of this function 
  64:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/FilteringFunctions/arm_conv_q15.c ****  *
  65:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/FilteringFunctions/arm_conv_q15.c ****  */
