 167:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Include/arm_math.h ****  * @defgroup groupMath Basic Math Functions
ARM GAS  C:\Users\Lamp\AppData\Local\Temp\ccyz797W.s 			page 9


 168:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Include/arm_math.h ****  */
